# SKYWELL: level 1 cleared from the foot of the shaft to the Tinker by a
# plain scripted player: nothing but button presses (recorded once from
# the demo climber, played back here through the real pad). The pit is
# the one seed 7 builds.
game skywell
wait 5
cheat seed 7
press A
expect state == 1
hold A 10
